cat <<EOF
minecraft-bedrock-wrapper has been installed as a systemd service.

To start/stop minecraft-bedrock-wrapper:

sudo systemctl start minecraft-bedrock-wrapper
sudo systemctl stop minecraft-bedrock-wrapper

To enable/disable minecraft-bedrock-wrapper starting automatically on boot:

sudo systemctl enable minecraft-bedrock-wrapper
sudo systemctl disable minecraft-bedrock-wrapper

To reload minecraft-bedrock-wrapper:

sudo systemctl restart minecraft-bedrock-wrapper

To view minecraft-bedrock-wrapper logs:

journalctl -f -u minecraft-bedrock-wrapper

EOF